From a67a5aa836be22fb7625c0a544da8669a9c90b34 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <dev@infoverify.local>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 05:02:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix admin session store type errors + clean up stray files

- package.json: add missing @types/express-mysql-session devDependency
  - without it, src/admin/setup.ts failed to type-check
  ("Could not find a declaration file for module 'express-mysql-session'").
- src/admin/setup.ts: fix session table naming bug - `tableName` was set
  at the top level of the MySQLStore options object, but the library
  only reads it nested under `schema.tableName` (confirmed against the
  library's own source). Left as-is, the session table would have
  silently been created as 'sessions' (the library's own default)
  instead of the intended 'admin_session'. Also added the same
  well-commented type assertion used elsewhere for the duplicate-
  mysql2-package-version type-identity mismatch (express-mysql-session
  and its @types package each pin a different exact mysql2 patch
  version than this app's own package.json, so npm can't dedupe them -
  `npm ls mysql2` confirms three separate copies) - verified functionally
  correct against a live local MySQL server, not papering over a real
  type error.
- Removed 3 empty stray files (node, npm,
  maria-digital-solutions-backend@0.1.0) and search_results.txt - looked
  like accidental artifacts from a local command, not part of the app.

Verified end-to-end against real local Postgres + MySQL servers:
- Applied the repo's real Prisma-generated baseline migration
  (prisma/migrations/20260908150000_init_mysql) to a fresh MySQL
  database - all 23 tables created correctly, @db.Text columns present
  where needed.
- Ran the repo's own scripts/migrate-postgres-to-mysql.mjs against
  seeded Postgres data (users, a BVN_CRM transaction with JSON metadata,
  a 415-character support ticket message) - every row-count matched,
  and JSON/long-text fields came across byte-for-byte intact.
- tsc: 0 errors in src/admin/setup.ts (was 2 before this commit); overall
  error count unchanged otherwise (only the same pre-existing stale-
  Prisma-client-class errors present everywhere in this repo, since this
  sandbox can't reach binaries.prisma.sh to run `prisma generate`).
- vitest: all 177 tests pass.
